# The sanitisation watchlist holds, in plaintext, the real values that were removed
# from this repository. It exists so tests/test_no_real_identifiers.py can catch them
# coming back. Publishing hashes of them instead was not good enough: one-word
# entries like a surname or a city are recoverable from a wordlist, which would
# re-disclose exactly what was removed. It must never be committed.
.sanitisation-watchlist
